{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05577","headline":"古木卧平沙 · 王泠然","name":"古木卧平沙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古木卧平沙，摧残岁月赊。\n有根横水石，无叶拂烟霞。\n春至苔爲叶，冬来雪作花。\n不逢星汉使，谁辨是灵槎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王泠然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05577.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05577","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}